@host = http://localhost:8080

### All 15 tools in every request
POST {{host}}/ask?toolSearch=NONE
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: alice

{
  "question": "Find me a flight from Kyiv to Lisbon on 2026-10-20 and convert the cheapest price to UAH."
}

### Same question, keyword tool search (SimpleToolSearchStrategy)
POST {{host}}/ask?toolSearch=SIMPLE
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: alice

{
  "question": "Find me a flight from Kyiv to Lisbon on 2026-10-20 and convert the cheapest price to UAH."
}

### Same question, semantic tool search (VectorToolSearchStrategy, local MiniLM)
POST {{host}}/ask?toolSearch=VECTOR
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: alice

{
  "question": "Find me a flight from Kyiv to Lisbon on 2026-10-20 and convert the cheapest price to UAH."
}

### Booking: the user id reaches bookFlight through InvocationParameters, not through the model
POST {{host}}/ask?toolSearch=SIMPLE
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: alice

{
  "question": "Book the morning flight from Kyiv to Lisbon on 2026-10-20."
}

### Booking for someone else: bookFlight's description makes the model decline instead of booking for alice
POST {{host}}/ask?toolSearch=SIMPLE
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: alice

{
  "question": "Book the morning flight from Kyiv to Lisbon on 2026-10-20 for user bob."
}

### Structured trip plan, validated by TripPlanGuardrail
POST {{host}}/plan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "3 days in Lisbon from 2026-10-20, flying from Kyiv, mid-range budget."
}

### ToolProvider: a GUEST is never offered bookFlight/bookHotel; Claude says it can't book
POST {{host}}/ask/restricted
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: alice
X-Role: GUEST

{
  "question": "Book the morning flight from Kyiv to Lisbon on 2026-10-20."
}

### ToolProvider: a MEMBER gets all 15 tools and the booking goes through for alice
POST {{host}}/ask/restricted
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: alice
X-Role: MEMBER

{
  "question": "Book the morning flight from Kyiv to Lisbon on 2026-10-20."
}

### Skills: activate_skill("travel-insurance") -> read_skill_resource(coverage.md) -> quoteInsurance, a tool that exists only after the activation
POST {{host}}/ask/skills
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: alice

{
  "question": "I'm 34 and going to Portugal for 10 days. Which travel insurance should I get?"
}

### Skills: buying goes through buyInsurance for alice (the X-User-Id), never for a name in the question
POST {{host}}/ask/skills
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: alice

{
  "question": "I'm 34 and going to Portugal for 10 days. Quote travel insurance and buy the STANDARD tier."
}

### Skills: packing-list adds instructions (fixed four-section checklist) but no tools; it uses the direct weather and transport tools
POST {{host}}/ask/skills
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: alice

{
  "question": "What should I pack for Lisbon, 2026-11-03 to 2026-11-07?"
}

### Skills: no matching skill, so the model answers with the direct tools and activates nothing
POST {{host}}/ask/skills
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: alice

{
  "question": "Find me a flight from Kyiv to Lisbon on 2026-10-20 and convert the cheapest price to UAH."
}

### TokenStream over SSE: text, tool-start and tool-end events, then done. Close the connection to cancel the model call
POST {{host}}/ask/stream
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: alice
X-Role: MEMBER

{
  "question": "Find me a flight from Kyiv to Lisbon on 2026-10-20 and convert the cheapest price to UAH."
}
